<title>SOUTH AFRICA: AMIC rights offer over-subscribed.</title>
<headline>AMIC rights offer over-subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Anglo American Industrial Corp (AMIC) said on Thursday its 12 for 100 rights offer to raise almost 1.2 billion rand had been over-subscribed when it closed on November 1.</p>
<p>&quot;In terms of the rights offer of 8,196,340 new ordinary shares of one rand each at a subscription price of 14,500 cents per share, subscriptions have been received for 8,290,196 new shares representing 101.15 percent of the total number offered,&quot; a statement said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +2711 482-1003</p>
</text>
